        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CUSTOMIZATION — four decisions ============ -->
    <section class="rb-cust" id="customize">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head section-head--center">
          <span class="eyebrow"><svg class="eyebrow-leaf" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4c-8.5 0-15 5.2-15.4 13 .6-3 2.7-5.6 6-6.7C15.4 8.8 19 7.5 20 4z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Customization</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal="up">Built Around the Product, <em>Not a Stock Size</em></h2>
          <p class="section-sub" data-reveal="up">Four decisions are settled before the press runs, and each is drawn against a real object rather than a catalogue page.</p>
